# Privacy Policy

**Last updated:** October 15, 2026

At **Story Daily Tech** (accessible from https://m.storydailyview.com), the privacy of our visitors is of extreme importance to us. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of personal information that is received and collected by Story Daily Tech and how it is used.

## 1. Information We Collect
Story Daily Tech operates as an independent technical and digital publication. We may collect non-personally identifiable information automatically via standard web server logs and analytics tools, including:
- Internet Protocol (IP) addresses
- Browser type and version
- Operating system details
- Date and time stamps
- Referring and exit pages
- Clickstream data and page interactions

This data is used solely to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movement around the website, and gather demographic information.

## 2. Cookies and Web Beacons
We use cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, record user-specific information on which pages the user accesses or visits, and customize web page content based on visitors' browser type or other information that the visitor sends via their browser.

## 3. Google AdSense & DoubleClick Cookie
- Third-party vendors, including **Google**, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet.
- Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to **Story Daily Tech** and other sites across the World Wide Web.
- Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting [Google Ads Settings](https://www.google.com/settings/ads). Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting [AboutAds.info](https://www.aboutads.info/choices/).

## 4. Third-Party Content & Analytics
We may partner with third-party analytics providers (such as Google Analytics) to help understand website traffic, audience retention, and usage patterns. These services collect information transmitted by your web browser as part of a standard web page request. Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technology in their respective advertisements and links that appear on Story Daily Tech, which are sent directly to your browser.

## 5. Children's Information
Story Daily Tech does not knowingly collect any personally identifiable information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that your child provided this kind of information on our website, we strongly encourage you to contact us immediately, and we will use our best efforts to promptly remove such information from our records.

## 6. Consent
By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.

## 7. Contact Us
If you have any questions, concerns, or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out via our [Contact Us](/contact) page or email us directly at **contact@storydailyview.com**.
